00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.780
no corporate sponsorships,
no kickbacks.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:37.380
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.440
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:42.640
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:47.040
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

